          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Da dighora wada? Diaghora, wandu wa mbari zima awo wisereilolieghe hachi, waipatire; uko kutalwa kukaia na hachi kupatikagha kwa chia ya irumirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Waisraeli awo wereilolieghe hachi kwa chia ya Sharia, walemelo ni kukatisha iyo Sharia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaki? Ni angu wereilolieghe kwa chia ya mabonyo wulalo ghoilola kwa chia ya irumirio. Kwa huwo wikaakuwa aighu ya ijo igho jekuwisha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
